 /><text x=70.0 y=128 text-anchor=middle>-60 ms</text><line class=\"g\" x1=177.5 x2=177.5 y1=4 y2=112 /><text x=177.5 y=128 text-anchor=middle>-30 ms</text><line class=\"g z\" x1=285.0 x2=285.0 y1=4 y2=112 /><text x=285.0 y=128 text-anchor=middle>+0 ms</text><line class=\"g\" x1=392.5 x2=392.5 y1=4 y2=112 /><text x=392.5 y=128 text-anchor=middle>+30 ms</text><line class=\"g\" x1=500.0 x2=500.0 y1=4 y2=112 /><text x=500.0 y=128 text-anchor=middle>+60 ms</text><text x=0 y=22>cam0 td</text><line class=stem x1=285.0 x2=484.0 y1=18 y2=18 /><circle class=dot cx=484.0 cy=18 r=5 /><text x=493.0 y=22 text-anchor=start>+55.54</text><text x=0 y=56>cam1 td</text><line class=stem x1=285.0 x2=484.4 y1=52 y2=52 /><circle class=dot cx=484.4 cy=52 r=5 /><text x=493.4 y=56 text-anchor=start>+55.63</text><text x=0 y=90>t_ga</text><line class=stem x1=285.0 x2=264.8 y1=86 y2=86 /><circle class=dot cx=264.8 cy=86 r=5 /><text x=255.8 y=90 text-anchor=end>−5.64</text></svg></div></div>", "results": "<p>Rotation is log(R) in rad, camera in the IMU frame.</p><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=scroll><table class=num><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>MVIS</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=grp><th colspan=2>cam0</th></tr><tr><td>fx px</td><td>917.17</td></tr><tr><td>fy px</td><td>916.98</td></tr><tr><td>cx px</td><td>959.65</td></tr><tr><td>cy px</td><td>565.20</td></tr><tr><td>k1</td><td>−0.02881</td></tr><tr><td>k2</td><td>−0.00873</td></tr><tr><td>k3</td><td>−0.01615</td></tr><tr><td>k4</td><td>0.03602</td></tr><tr><td>Lever x mm</td><td>−12.63</td></tr><tr><td>Lever y mm</td><td>−21.32</td></tr><tr><td>Lever z mm</td><td>−20.22</td></tr><tr><td>log(R) rad</td><td>[+0.0229, −3.1248, −0.0213]</td></tr><tr><td>td ms</td><td>+55.542</td></tr><tr><td>Reprojection px</td><td>0.193</td></tr><tr><td>Readout ms</td><td>−26.48</td></tr><tr class=grp><th colspan=2>cam1</th></tr><tr><td>fx px</td><td>922.94</td></tr><tr><td>fy px</td><td>922.68</td></tr><tr><td>cx px</td><td>893.99</td></tr><tr><td>cy px</td><td>561.57</td></tr><tr><td>k1</td><td>−0.03215</td></tr><tr><td>k2</td><td>−0.00138</td></tr><tr><td>k3</td><td>0.00529</td></tr><tr><td>k4</td><td>−0.01140</td></tr><tr><td>Lever x mm</td><td>+49.48</td></tr><tr><td>Lever y mm</td><td>−20.49</td></tr><tr><td>Lever z mm</td><td>−21.84</td></tr><tr><td>log(R) rad</td><td>[+0.0220, −3.1168, −0.0083]</td></tr><tr><td>td ms</td><td>+55.635</td></tr><tr><td>Reprojection px</td><td>0.197</td></tr><tr><td>Readout ms</td><td>−26.55</td></tr><tr class=grp><th colspan=2>IMU</th></tr><tr><td>t_ga ms</td><td>−5.64 ± 0.64</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>", "limits": "<ul class=list><li>One recording, with no independent reference. These values show what MVIS solved, not how close they are to the truth.</li><li>Gyro scale solves 3 to 4 % below 1 on all axes. We have not confirmed the cause.</li></ul>", "run": "<ul class=list><li>Recording converted to EuRoC layout, camera-only solve per camera, then camera + IMU with camera intrinsics free, t_ga on and the rolling-shutter readout estimated. Batch of 2026-11-03.</li><li>sha256 of the recording: <code>ca4b6bf961f687762de94f941891e3b32eb5edf174f5529f5470eaecdb3a883b</code></li></ul>", "header": "<div class=sd><div class=sd-grid><div class=sd-head><a class=sd-maker href=\"https://www.gilabs.xyz/\">General Intelligence Labs ↗︎</a><h1 id=\"_top\">GI Ego1</h1><p class=sd-type>Head-worn stereo headset: colour rolling-shutter fisheye cameras, 9-DoF IMU</p></div><figure class=sd-plate><div class=sd-frame><img src=\"/media/sensors/gi-ego1/gi-ego1gs.jpg\" alt=\"GI headset on a mannequin head, three-quarter view\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\"></div><figcaption><a href=\"https://www.gilabs.xyz/products/ego1gs\">Photo: General Intelligence Labs, GI EGO1GS product page ↗︎</a></figcaption></figure><div class=sd-cta><div class=sd-buttons><a class=\"sd-btn primary\" href=\"https://www.gilabs.xyz/products/ego1\">Product page ↗︎</a><a class=sd-btn href=\"#specifications\">All specs (5)